msgid "With [`BackendStatus`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status), you can find the QPU status (for example, `Active`, `Paused`, `Offline`) as well as the number of pending jobs.\n"
msgstr "Mit [`BackendStatus`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status) kannst du den QPU-Status (z. B. `Active`, `Paused`, `Offline`) sowie die Anzahl der ausstehenden Jobs finden.\n"

